title: "Bacterial DNA Annotator: annotation, metabolic pathways and regulation"
type: software
version: 1.1.3
date-released: "2026-11-23"
license: MIT
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24469732"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Krim10000/Bacterial-DNA-Annotator"
